00:56:55.850 --> 00:57:13.200
<v Ira Glass>He and I were running to an appointment this week on this 50-story skyscraper. We stopped first at the 45th story, where we thought our appointment was. We were sure it was 45. It wasn't right. Then we looked on 44, and 46, and 42, and 48. I was confused about which story. He was confused about which story.

00:57:13.200 --> 00:57:17.790
<v Jill Ciment>I don't think I understand my story any better than I did at 45.

00:57:17.790 --> 00:57:22.790
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
